data: {"type": "assistant", "id": "a7", "content": "## What to change\n\n1. **Put \"coffee subscription\" in the H1.** It's the top non-branded query (18k impressions, position 8.4) and the top converting Ads keyword (214 conversions). Suggested: *\"Fresh coffee subscription, roasted to order\"*.\n2. **Keep \"worth waking up for\" as the subhead.** It's your voice, but nobody searches it.\n3. **Say \"delivery\".** *Fresh roasted coffee delivery* gets 9.6k impressions and the page never uses the word.\n4. **Move gifts above the fold.** *Gift coffee subscription* converts at 10.2%, your best rate.\n5. **Add a sourcing line.** *Ethically sourced coffee* converts at 7.6% and the page doesn't mention sourcing.\n\nBranded queries (41% of clicks) were left out of the scoring."}
